#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:73
msgid ""
"Confirm the supervisor and worker commands exist, inspect the supervisor's supported "
"options, and choose the working directory used by the image."
msgstr ""
"Confirmar a existência dos comandos supervisor e worker, inspecionar as opções "
"suportadas pelo supervisor e escolher o diretório de trabalho usado pela imagem."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:82
msgid ""
"Before starting processes, check the ports allocated to that node. For the secondary "
"use ports 9992, 9912, 9552 and 9652; for the worker use port 9921."
msgstr ""
"Antes de iniciar os processos, verifique as portas alocadas nesse nó. Para as portas "
"de uso secundário 9992, 9912, 9552 e 9652; para o porto de uso do trabalhador 9921."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:84
msgid "Primary-node port check"
msgstr "Verificação de portas do nó primário"

