msgid "Start the cluster"
msgstr "Iniciar o cluster"

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:103
msgid ""
"Run each command on its designated node, after exporting the shared database URL. "
"Logs are written to the working directory."
msgstr ""
"Execute cada comando no seu nó designado, depois de exportar o URL do banco de dados "
"partilhado. Os registos são gravados na pasta de trabalho."

