#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:150
msgid "Configure the unified entry"
msgstr "Configurar o ponto de entrada unificado"

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:152
msgid ""
"Run the HA script on the Nginx node. It renders the OpenResty configuration and "
"starts or reloads Nginx. The supplied script supports two supervisor backends; "
"additional backends need a separate load-balancer configuration."
msgstr ""
"Executar o HA o programa no Nginx  nó. Ele renderiza o OpenResty  configuração e "
"inicia ou recarrega Nginx. O script fornecido suporta duas infra- estruturas de "
"supervisor; as infra- estruturas adicionais precisam de uma configuração de "
"balanceador de carga separada."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:163
msgid ""
"The entry checks both supervisors' status endpoints and routes requests to the "
"available primary. Use the unified entry for model deployment and client requests."
msgstr ""
"O ponto de entrada verifica o status dos dois supervisors e encaminha as solicitações"
" ao primário disponível. Use o ponto de entrada unificado para implantação de modelos"
" e solicitações dos clientes."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:175
msgid "Acceptance checks"
msgstr "Verificações de aceitação"

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:177
msgid "Check both supervisors directly and then check the unified entry."
msgstr ""
"Verifique ambos os supervisores diretamente e, em seguida, verifique a entrada "
"unificada."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:189
msgid ""
"Expect version information from the primary, ``it is a secondary supervisor`` from "
"the secondary version endpoint, and the worker in both status responses. Initially "
"the unified entry reports ``has_transfered=false`` and ``active_node=primary``."
msgstr ""
"Espere informações de versão do primário,  ``it is a secondary supervisor``  do "
"endpoint de versão do secundário e o worker nas duas respostas de status. "
"Inicialmente, o ponto de entrada unificado informa  ``has_transfered=false``  e  "
"``active_node=primary`` ."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:191
msgid ""
"Deploy a model through the unified entry and test actual inference. Inspect both "
"supervisor logs for synchronized replica routing metadata before testing failover."
msgstr ""
"Implantar um modelo através da entrada unificada e testar a inferência real. "
"Inspecione ambos os registros de supervisores para os metadados sincronizados de "
"roteamento de réplicas antes de testar o failover."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:198
msgid ""
"Successful secondary replay of ``META_REPLICA_MAP_INFO`` indicates that replica-to-"
"worker routes were synchronized."
msgstr ""
"A reprodução bem-sucedida de  ``META_REPLICA_MAP_INFO``  no secundário indica que as "
"rotas das réplicas para os workers foram sincronizadas."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:201
msgid "Optional failover drill and recovery"
msgstr "Exercício opcional de troca em caso de falha e recuperação"

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst
msgid "Test a primary failure in a test environment"
msgstr "Testar uma falha do primário em um ambiente de testes"

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:205
msgid ""
"This drill intentionally stops the primary supervisor. Run it separately from routine"
" installation and only in the environment chosen for failure testing."
msgstr ""
"Este exercício interrompe intencionalmente o supervisor primário. Execute-o "
"separadamente da instalação rotineira e apenas no ambiente escolhido para testes de "
"falha."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:207
msgid "On the example primary node:"
msgstr "No nó primário do exemplo:"

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:215
msgid ""
"Poll the secondary version endpoint. Once it returns version information instead of "
"the secondary-role message, inspect promotion and worker-reconnection logs."
msgstr ""
"Consulte periodicamente o endpoint de versão do secundário. Quando ele retornar "
"informações de versão em vez da mensagem de papel secundário, examine os logs de "
"promoção e reconexão dos workers."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:223
msgid "Expected log indicators"
msgstr "Indicadores esperados nos logs"

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:230
msgid ""
"Check the unified entry again. The recorded configuration checks approximately every "
"two seconds and switches after five failures; this is a configuration-specific "
"timing, not a guaranteed recovery time."
msgstr ""
"Verifique novamente o ponto de entrada unificado. A configuração documentada faz uma "
"verificação aproximadamente a cada dois segundos e troca de nó após cinco falhas. "
"Esse intervalo depende da configuração e não é um tempo de recuperação garantido."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:238
msgid ""
"Expect ``has_transfered=true`` and ``active_node=backup``, with the old primary down "
"and the backup up. Send a real chat request to the already deployed model through the"
" same entry."
msgstr ""
"Espere  ``has_transfered=true``  e  ``active_node=backup`` , com o antigo primário "
"parado e o backup ativo. Envie uma solicitação real de chat ao modelo já implantado "
"pelo mesmo ponto de entrada."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:240
msgid ""
"If inference cannot find the model, inspect the new primary's routing logs and the "
"earlier replica-map replay. A successful role change alone does not establish that "
"the model is still reachable."
msgstr ""
"Se a inferência não encontrar o modelo, examine os logs de roteamento do novo "
"primário e a reprodução anterior do mapa de réplicas. Uma mudança de papel bem-"
"sucedida, por si só, não comprova que o modelo ainda esteja acessível."

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals preserved. Navigation and selected
#. terminology reviewed.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:246
msgid ""
"After recovering the former primary, rejoin it as a secondary with the current "
"primary's addresses and the same shared database. Avoid automatically reclaiming the "
"primary role. Verify metadata synchronization, node status and inference again."
msgstr ""
"Depois de recuperar o primário anterior, volte a reuni- lo como secundário com os "
"endereços primários atuais e o mesmo banco de dados compartilhado. Evite recuperar "
"automaticamente o papel primário. Verifique a sincronização de metadados, o estado do"
" nó e a inferência novamente."

